ments, as well as fund offerings. This segment also offers pension accumulation products and services, mutual funds, asset management, income annuities, and life insurance accumulation products, as well as voluntary savings plans. The Benefits and Protection segment provides specialty benefits, such as specialty benefits group dental and vision insurance, group life and other insurance, and group and individual disability insurance, as well as administers group dental, disability, and vision benefits; and individual life insurance products comprising universal, variable universal, indexed universal, and term life insurance products. This segment serves insurance solutions for small and medium-sized businesses and their owners, as well as employees. The company was founded in 1879 and is based in Des Moines, Iowa.","employees":19700,"website":"https://www.principal.com","country":"United States","city":"Des Moines","officers":[{"name":"Ms. Deanna Dawnette Strable-Soethout","title":"President, CEO & Chair of the Board"},{"name":"Mr. Joel Michael Pitz","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Ms. Amy Christine Friedrich","title":"President of Benefits & Protection"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":10.38,"tpe":12.64,"ps":3.401,"pfcf":12.38,"peg":1.32,"pb":1.583,"ev_ebitda":10.59,"rev_growth":0.1,"eps_growth":0.1435,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1311,"eps_growth_next":0.107,"div_yield":0.0216,"roe":0.1281,"roa":0.01589,"de":55.49,"gross_margin":0.2386,"op_margin":0.3556,"profit_margin":0.2563,"current_ratio":1.503},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":11.0,"sector":10.38,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":15.9,"sector":12.64,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.429,"sector":3.401,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"sector":12.38,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.06,"sector":1.32,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":2.01,"sector":1.583,"verdict":"Overvalue